@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Conceptual import lock (illustrative, not an accepted schema)

rectangle "root composition\nfarm-irrigation@composition-rev-17\nsha256:ROOT...17" as ROOT
rectangle "instance east-zone-01\n(own state, timers, ports,\nsettings, binding, provenance)" as E
rectangle "instance west-zone-02\n(own state, timers, ports,\nsettings, binding, provenance)" as W
rectangle "definition\nirrigation-controller@rev-42\nsha256:DEF...42" as DEF
rectangle "rain-policy@rev-8\nsha256:RAIN...08" as RAIN

ROOT --> E
ROOT --> W
E --> DEF : pins
W --> DEF : pins (same digest)
DEF --> RAIN : import (transitive)
note bottom of RAIN
transitive closure: ROOT...17, DEF...42, RAIN...08
end note
@enduml
